  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Requesting VRC badges displayed within Canny to gauge involvement of other canny users, namely account age. Canny accounts are inherently linked to VRC accounts. When considering which posts to upvote, it would be nice as a consideration to the writing of the post to see how involved that user within VRC to have an understanding of how to comment upon or interpret what they have written. We don't have the ability to see other posts by the user which is perhaps a bit overprotective, but showing account badges here on Canny may be a nice and engagement provoking middle ground.",
